    <briefdescription>
<para>This namespace provides the hard-coded microplane quadrature schemes (orientations and integration weights on the unit hemisphere) and the two kinematic constraints built on top of them: the volumetric-deviatoric (V-D) split (<ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_continuum_mechanics_1_1_microplane_1_1_v_d_split" kindref="compound">VDSplit</ref>) and the normal-tangential (N-T) split (<ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_continuum_mechanics_1_1_microplane_1_1_n_t_split" kindref="compound">NTSplit</ref>). Both classes construct their projection tensors from the same discretization (Discretization::get()) and provide the corresponding virtual-work homogenization back to the macroscopic stress/tangent. </para>
    </briefdescription>
